  first | exact @GlobalTheory.WeilL2Convergence.tendsto_l2A_diffQuot | exact GlobalTheory.WeilL2Convergence.tendsto_l2A_diffQuot | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.WeilL2Convergence.tendsto_l2A_diffQuot <;> assumption)
